# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# PostgreSQL is now used instead of SQLite — no local .db file to track.
# Data lives in the PostgreSQL database configured via the DB_* environment
# variables (see .env.example). Tables are auto-created on startup by
# init_db.py if they do not already exist.
*.db
*.sqlite3
